{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for volunteering for the Exovia Project, Pioneer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In the outer reaches of the cosmos awaits a massive asteroid containing all the raw materials needed for building Humanity\u2019s warp gate. Mine the asteroid, and explore all it has to offer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine The Asteroid</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/c381713fe4f1ad2c363974041380dd8c.poster.avif?t=1772661120\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/c381713fe4f1ad2c363974041380dd8c.webm?t=1772661120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/c381713fe4f1ad2c363974041380dd8c.mp4?t=1772661120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining creates chaos in zero-g. Floaters scatter in every direction, bouncing off walls and each other. Use your mining laser to break rock and your vacuum to collect resources, or engineer systems that mine and carry floaters back to base without you lifting a finger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build A Zero-G Factory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/257a52cd47bdcb75d5bab807fc8a7049.poster.avif?t=1772661120\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/257a52cd47bdcb75d5bab807fc8a7049.webm?t=1772661120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/extras/257a52cd47bdcb75d5bab807fc8a7049.mp4?t=1772661120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conveyor belts do not work in zero gravity. Create free-floating physics-based automation and logistics systems to send resources drifting through your factory. Setup production chains that turn raw resources into specialized parts for constructing the warp gate. Higher output demands smarter logistics and every solution opens a new problem worth solving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore The Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your asteroid is a frontier. It's massive, procedurally unique to you, and holds many hours of exploration. What you uncover is yours alone, and no two asteroids are the same. Discover secretes and mine new resources as you venture forward into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve One Problem and Then the Next!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your own pace as you experiment, tinker, and redesign. No rush. No threat. No resource lost on deconstruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the soothing beats as you mine in blissful solitude.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3144430?t=1772661120","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/0a162436773839178c5bb9bbd758126e8e077582/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772661120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/81871611705efef1355bafc0d5aebceb655f19e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772661120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/81871611705efef1355bafc0d5aebceb655f19e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772661120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"de