8a7049.mp4?t=1772661120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conveyor belts do not work in zero gravity. Create free-floating physics-based automation and logistics systems to send resources drifting through your factory. Setup production chains that turn raw resources into specialized parts for constructing the warp gate. Higher output demands smarter logistics and every solution opens a new problem worth solving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore The Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your asteroid is a frontier. It's massive, procedurally unique to you, and holds many hours of exploration. What you uncover is yours alone, and no two asteroids are the same. Discover secretes and mine new resources as you venture forward into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve One Problem and Then the Next!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your own pace as you experiment, tinker, and redesign. No rush. No threat. No resource lost on deconstruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the soothing beats as you mine in blissful solitude.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ByteRockers' Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144430/25c7e9a01a7752bbfac2f2be7348da1867e13c11/header.jpg?t=1772661120","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright ByteRockers' Games GmbH & Co. KG. All rights reserved. ByteRockers Games is a trademark registered in Germany and the USA.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3144430/105812250/cd25c33ef21fdcce77907655318dac42f6e03168/1772014366/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772014866","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3144430/105812250/cd25c33ef21fdcce77907655318dac42f6e03168/1772014366/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772